<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The proposed crowdfunding model for financing movies and web series marks a real change from the old, investor-driven way of making films. Instead of relying on a handful of financiers who often influence creative choices, it invites the audience themselves to be part of the journey. This gives filmmakers especially independent and first-time creators the freedom to tell the stories they believe in, while still getting the financial, promotional, and even hands-on support they need.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
